    <string name="choose_region_title">Choose your region</string>
    <string name="choose_region_body">Pick a region to install on this phone. OpenWild is an offline field guide for plants, fungi, and edibles. Identification only uses species recorded in the region you choose, and it works offline after the pack is installed. Packs can be updated over time. A listed region without a finished pack has nothing to download — nothing is invented for it.</string>
